OL,3,GNEWSANo time for new minister to fix
OL,4,Ahealth service warns top doctor
OL,5,
OL,6,FDoctors have warned the health service
OL,7,Fin Northern Ireland does not have the
OL,8,Frequired staff due to an "abject
OL,9,Ffailure of workforce planning", and
OL,10,Fthere is not enough time to make
OL,11,Fchanges before the next election.
OL,13,FDr Clodagh Corrigan, who is the deputy
OL,14,Fchair of the British Medical
OL,15,FAssociation, said Northern Ireland
OL,16,F"does not have the surgeons and the
OL,17,Fstaff to have all specialities across
OL,18,Fall sites".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
