OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANo time for new minister to fix
OL,4,Ahealth service warns top doctor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis comes as the new health minister
OL,7,Ffor Northern Ireland is expected to be
OL,8,Fannounced later following the
OL,9,Fresignation of Ulster Unionist Mike
OL,10,FNesbitt from the post.
OL,12,FAn emergency meeting of Stormont's
OL,13,Fhealth committee is also due to take
OL,14,Fplace on Thursday to discuss the fall
OL,15,Fout from Nesbitt's resignation.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
